                'title' => 'Getting Started with Laravel: A Beginner\'s Guide',
                'short_description' => 'Learn the basics of Laravel framework and build your first web application with this comprehensive guide.',
                'content' => '<h2>Introduction to Laravel</h2><p>Laravel is a powerful PHP framework that provides an elegant syntax and tools for building modern web applications. In this guide, we\'ll explore the fundamentals of Laravel and help you get started on your development journey.</p><h2>Why Choose Laravel?</h2><p>Laravel offers numerous benefits including:</p><ul><li>Elegant and expressive syntax</li><li>Powerful ORM (Eloquent)</li><li>Robust routing system</li><li>Built-in authentication</li><li>Extensive ecosystem</li></ul><h2>Setting Up Your First Laravel Project</h2><p>To create a new Laravel project, simply run the following command in your terminal:</p><pre><code>composer create-project laravel/laravel my-first-app</code></pre><h2>Understanding the Directory Structure</h2><p>Laravel follows a well-organized directory structure that separates concerns and makes development more manageable. Key directories include:</p><ul><li><strong>app/</strong> - Contains your application logic</li><li><strong>resources/views/</strong> - Holds your Blade templates</li><strong>routes/</strong> - Defines your application routes</li><li><strong>database/</strong> - Contains migrations and seeders</li></ul><h2>Creating Your First Route</h2><p>Routes in Laravel are defined in the routes/web.php file. Here\'s a simple example:</p><pre><code>Route::get(\'/\', function () {    return view(\'welcome\');});</code></pre><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>Laravel is an excellent choice for web development due to its elegant syntax, powerful features, and extensive documentation. Start exploring Laravel today and discover why it\'s one of the most popular PHP frameworks!</p>',
